{
 "batchId": "b-0060",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "zh-Hans",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_989b451cb7aeee740da1",
   "sourceHash": "989b451cb7aeee740da128aabd659e2746c885b06ea0cdef6b55ceec76620ba1",
   "text": "自然管理糖尿病：来自 Kairali 阿育吠陀疗愈村的成功故事",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_aefdb98458283401fe4a",
   "sourceHash": "aefdb98458283401fe4a1ace5fef4dff583b3c5a9572198feb53d6d887efa23c",
   "text": "在来到 Kairali 阿育吠陀疗愈村之前，管理糖尿病对我来说似乎是一场永无止境的斗争。个性化膳食规划和草药制剂等阿育吠陀治疗帮助我以自然的方式控制了血糖水平。再加上有指导的瑜伽课程和舒缓的按摩，我感到比以前更有活力、更平衡。在向知识丰富的工作人员学习了可持续的生活方式调整后，我的健康状况有了明显改善。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4b977640f6b44607d395",
   "sourceHash": "4b977640f6b44607d3955737145d67a56a67dac60c8916b828e4cac3874d7139",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]Rashi 女士[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]★★★★★[[CLOSE_2]][[OPEN_3]]5.0[[CLOSE_3]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_053bdaf55df5f264f38c",
   "sourceHash": "053bdaf55df5f264f38c9b8c20dffb9fb826e1a4f6251bdc9390e9a24de0ecbb",
   "text": "如果我正在使用胰岛素或其他糖尿病药物，可以参加吗？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9f1324121925dd562d43",
   "sourceHash": "9f1324121925dd562d4384e15656f80d97132631f8f029c8df6e125892635f84",
   "text": "请将您目前的治疗情况告知您的糖尿病主治医生和阿育吠陀医生。在预订之前，请询问饮食、活动或拟定疗法的变化将如何与您的糖尿病治疗相协调。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2809c269c0c7b22aef2d",
   "sourceHash": "2809c269c0c7b22aef2df80f637a1b7f7ccd3f65ec653949164d44fcd1e50e91",
   "text": "糖尿病与代谢平衡治疗 · Madhumeha Chikitsa（奇基察）（Kairali 糖尿病治疗）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Source joins 'Therapy' and 'Madhumeha' with no separator; a middle dot was added between the two titles."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2dd90ab5ff8e11226f4c",
   "sourceHash": "2dd90ab5ff8e11226f4c79ef31c6d258457c6a9629570d48ebe73a096d6f9437",
   "text": "Kairali 阿育吠陀糖尿病与代谢治疗",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Retreat' omitted/replaced to avoid resort/holiday connotation; title reads 'Ayurvedic Diabetes & Metabolic Therapy at Kairali'."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_22c6971ca5f3e3cec95e",
   "sourceHash": "22c6971ca5f3e3cec95ed49ccce5a621cd6815c28635820c8f8c167146b986e7",
   "text": "使用数字血糖仪进行指尖采血血糖检测。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_325bddbf12bb25c5d2e4",
   "sourceHash": "325bddbf12bb25c5d2e433f238a0de88132a6247aecd858a9fa371b231bc3b30",
   "text": "一个人躺在木制治疗床上，治疗师正在为其按摩手臂。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_832026db570a5f22a089",
   "sourceHash": "832026db570a5f22a0898c4ec5a072250fac8904558b8fc97ca7a7b996f1b19d",
   "text": "阿育吠陀糖尿病治疗流程",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0bbb0a1bb2effe0a359f",
   "sourceHash": "0bbb0a1bb2effe0a359f6961b5db725b4b716540ce87a9b5fa1c45e9feb91163",
   "text": "阿育吠陀糖尿病治疗的益处",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f18bee931711e83113a8",
   "sourceHash": "f18bee931711e83113a800d551c117ac8297578440df8b20b1942dcf1a1c3c8c",
   "text": "抵达后，您将与我们经验丰富的阿育吠陀医生进行全面问诊。医生会评估您的病史、当前症状和生活方式因素，为您制定个性化的治疗计划。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b410f892862380619fad",
   "sourceHash": "b410f892862380619fad7c20a0bf00b2c67a8bbd38cc42def02e258aec43822d",
   "text": "Panchakarma（五业疗法）排毒",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_45b7c33d98b333aedcf6",
   "sourceHash": "45b7c33d98b333aedcf6381c4346505d6ecf8d845b234813a53b73b221b6b600",
   "text": "Panchakarma（五业疗法）是一系列排毒疗法，是本治疗的重要组成部分。其中包括 Virechana（治疗性泻下）和 Basti（药物灌肠）等疗程，用于排出毒素、改善消化并恢复平衡。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0df5910b8731512cad6b",
   "sourceHash": "0df5910b8731512cad6b920f952810c4f5db232821248d74c3a972fef283471d",
   "text": "草药治疗",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_637889a4fd8c50525719",
   "sourceHash": "637889a4fd8c50525719fba4d84eb6f2850bf6482c99e8c4bf6eb1689ea0b24f",
   "text": "医生会开具定制的草药，用于调节血糖水平、增强胰腺功能并支持整体健康。这些天然制剂由具有降糖特性的阿育吠陀草药配制而成。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8fae531999b7b87daf5c",
   "sourceHash": "8fae531999b7b87daf5cfeea90c49ae427e90c141059e45cffef1ec90abc246c",
   "text": "疗法治疗",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3a3537948ef5d2d03bee",
   "sourceHash": "3a3537948ef5d2d03beef1305090513da6fe3cb197701360e363de8cedcc48ed",
   "text": "我们会实施一系列阿育吠陀疗法，以应对特定的失衡并促进康复。这些疗法可能包括 Abhyangam（阿比扬伽，草药油按摩）、Shirodhara（希罗达拉，额头淋油疗法）和 Udwarthanam（乌德瓦塔纳姆，草药粉按摩）。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ae0e9230b8eb5a137854",
   "sourceHash": "ae0e9230b8eb5a137854507631006e91f4976371a6d7384cf0d0dbe944d5b843",
   "text": "饮食与生活方式调整",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4a80552a7ae0c141f86c",
   "sourceHash": "4a80552a7ae0c141f86c893de3f3dfaf6c978d8fa94f4ac2d1e209bdf3fb166e",
   "text": "我们的专业营养师会提供个性化的饮食建议，帮助您有效管理糖尿病。您将在指导下建立均衡的饮食，纳入已知有助于调节血糖水平的特定食物和香料。同时也会建议您进行生活方式调整，例如运动和压力管理技巧。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2c3d3a86dc685ac11518",
   "sourceHash": "2c3d3a86dc685ac115188178897a742986506753f13d2a9592517f74348534ea",
   "text": "瑜伽体式、调息法（pranayama，呼吸练习）和冥想课程都会纳入治疗计划。这些练习有助于减轻压力、改善胰岛素敏感性并促进整体健康。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a4b8e35917cb8025ca4d",
   "sourceHash": "a4b8e35917cb8025ca4d042b49a449156e398ff06d19027485140230f0246f3e",
   "text": "随访与维持",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_eb1e575fff3e39140983",
   "sourceHash": "eb1e575fff3e39140983eed64ff624172102adf052171e38a40b9722e82b7d78",
   "text": "完成强化治疗后，您将获得关于保持健康生活方式和长期管理糖尿病的指导。我们会提供定期随访咨询和支持，以跟踪进展，并对治疗计划作出必要的调整。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
